    "Mosin Sniper Unique.Explanation": "Mosin Sniper >The Unheard Edition & AMR & Hypersonic & No-Bolt<\nThis unique variant is chambered in 12.7x108mm, uses The Unheard Edition magazines, has massive visible recoil, functions as a DMR, and features extreme muzzle velocity",
