    "ASh-12 Unique.Description": "If you think this is still ASh-12 you know and love, you need to look again and question what you see",
    "ASh-12 Unique.Explanation": "ASh-12 >Hypersonic Point & Laser Click<\nThis unique variant turns the ASh-12 into a completely different weapon. Even if the insane fire rate and muzzle velocity are the first things you notice, the 4-round burst mode and lack of recoil take this weapon to such absurd levels that you start questioning whether the caliber change to 9x21mm, with SR-2M magazines, was even a nerf or a buff",
