    "Sawed-off Unique.Name": ">Bullshit Launcher<",
    "Sawed-off Unique.Description": "- Sir, we don't have any more ammo left! We only have some random grenade launcher rounds and flares!\n- \"Flares\"? Stick them into this shotgun and make a good use of them!\n- But sir, the flare damage is bullshit...\n- You know what is bullshit? This gun. Bullshit launcher. So don't panic, we have other weapons for this!",
    "Sawed-off Unique.Explanation": "Sawed-off >Bullshit Launcher<\nThis unique variant is chambered in 40x46mm grenades, 30x29mm grenades, and 26x75mm flare ammunition, making this the ultimate \"I am out of ammo, what do I do?\" kind of weapon",
