    "FN 5-7 Unique.Explanation": "FN 5-7 >Automatic P2W<\nThis unique variant blends the characteristics of the Pay-2-Win - .50 cal caliber with special overpriced magazines, and Automatic - only full auto fire mode with slightly decreased ergonomics, variant types",
